HADOOP-12542. TestDNS fails on Windows after HADOOP-12437.
 Contributed by Chris Nauroth.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the fact that Windows does not resolve the loopback address (127.0.0.1) to "localhost" despite the presence of the corresponding entry in the hosts file. This behavior led to test failures in the `TestDNS` class when running on Windows systems, as the tests were not designed to account for this platform-specific issue.

